<headroom-library version="1" id="ambient-cathedral-swell" category="Ambient &amp; FX" order="10" instrument="guitar" style="Ambient">
  <description>Clean chords bloom into a pad: a soft compressor and a sparkling clean amp feed an octave-up shimmer delay and a huge, slowly modulated reverb. Let chords ring and swell with your volume knob.</description>
